{
  "description": "Two CLI parameter names on `benchbox run` don't clearly express user intent:\n\n1. `--convert` is a verb describing the implementation action (converting files),\n   not the user's intent (choosing a table format). Users think \"I want to\n   benchmark with Delta Lake\", not \"I want to convert my data.\"\n\n2. `--data-format` coexists ambiguously with the new `--table-format`. It controls\n   pre-sorted data generation (parquet-sorted, delta-sorted, iceberg-sorted) and\n   pairs with `--sorted-ingestion-mode`/`--sorted-ingestion-method`.\n\nRenaming to `--table-format` aligns with industry terminology (\"open table formats\"),\nthe BenchBox blog series title, and pairs naturally with `--table-mode`.\n\nRenaming to `--presort` removes the \"format\" confusion and aligns with the\nsorted-ingestion parameter family.\n\nAlpha status: no backward compatibility needed.\n\nDesign decisions:\n- `benchbox convert` subcommand: KEEP as-is (verb appropriate for subcommand)\n- `FormatConversionOrchestrator`: KEEP as-is (internal; it IS a conversion orchestrator)\n- Post-run summary label: \"Convert\" → \"Table Format\"\n- `prompt_data_format()` → `prompt_table_format()` (feeds into --table-format, not --data-format)\n- JSON output keys: clean break (convert_format → table_format, etc.)\n\nFull plan: .claude/plans/lazy-hugging-unicorn.md",
  "legacy": {
    "anti_patterns": [
      {
        "dont": "add backward compatibility aliases",
        "instead": "just rename directly",
        "item_id": "rename-convert-and-data-format-cli-params",
        "why": "we are in Alpha status"
      },
      {
        "dont": "rename data_format variables in unrelated modules (TPC-DI, InfluxDB, DataFusion)",
        "instead": "only rename the CLI parameter and its direct usage path",
        "item_id": "rename-convert-and-data-format-cli-params",
        "why": "those refer to different concepts"
      },
      {
        "dont": "rename the `benchbox convert` subcommand",
        "instead": "only rename the --convert parameter on `benchbox run`",
        "item_id": "rename-convert-and-data-format-cli-params",
        "why": "verbs are appropriate for subcommand names"
      }
    ],
